  "summary": "Transformer models have been applied to sepsis early warning in several ICU studies. Haddad et al. (2020) used a transformer model on ICU vital signs from the IEEE-CIS dataset and reported an F1 score of 0.675 [D0104]. Novak et al. (2018) evaluated a transformer model on the AgriSat dataset, achieving an AUROC of 0.6 [D0102]. Okafor et al. (2019) also applied transformers to the same AgriSat data, obtaining an accuracy of 0.873, while Novak et al. (2021) explored attention‑only encoder architectures on the HateCheck dataset, reporting a MAPE of 0.935 [D0103][D0101].",
